{"id": "ec4e4acd-b2d4-4be8-887a-e182633c9303", "slug": "aesthetic-synthesis", "title": "Aesthetic Synthesis", "description": "Aesthetic Synthesis Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aesthetic Synthesis\"\ndescription: \"Aesthetic Synthesis Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#DCDCC6\"\n  secondary: \"#1C2016\"\n  accent: \"#DCDCC6\"\n  background: \"#DCDCC6\"\n  surface: \"#1C2016\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#DCDCC6\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aesthetic Synthesis\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 84; favorites: 5; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nAesthetic Synthesis Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nPrologue Elevating modern aesthetics through intentional design. A curated approach to visual storytelling that transcends traditional boundaries, focusing on structural purity. (Series 01) A I B Sartorial Synthesis Dis…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Prologue; Sartorial Synthesis.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #DCDCC6, secondary #1C2016, accent #DCDCC6, background #DCDCC6, surface #1C2016, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aesthetic Synthesis</title>\n    \n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    \n    <!-- Tailwind -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        surface: '#f5f5f0', // Off-white\n                        panel: '#dcdcc6',   // Muted sage/khaki\n                        ink: '#1c2016',     // Very dark green/black\n                        line: '#c2c2a3',    // Grid line color\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Icons & Animation -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-surface text-ink overflow-x-hidden w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col md:flex-row selection:bg-panel selection:text-ink\">\n\n    <!-- Left Pane: Hero Imagery & WebGL -->\n    <section class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-[60vh] md:h-screen overflow-hidden left-pane z-10\">\n        <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n        <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 opacity-40 mix-blend-multiply pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        \n        <!-- Main Hero Image -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-10 overflow-hidden bg-ink\">\n            <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780478940196-2b5c635b-9feb-4574-93d3-a8ee3de4604c.png\" alt=\"Editorial Fashion Presentation\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center hero-img origin-center scale-110\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780478940196-2b5c635b-9feb-4574-93d3-a8ee3de4604c.png\">\n            <!-- Subtle gradient overlay for better text contrast if needed, though mostly image here -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Right Pane: Structured Grid Layout -->\n    <section class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 min-h-screen bg-line flex items-center justify-center p-2 md:p-8 right-pane relative z-20\">\n        \n        <!-- Main Grid Container mimicking the reference composition -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl bg-line grid grid-cols-12 gap-[1px] md:gap-[2px] right-grid\">\n            \n            <!-- --- TOP BLOCK --- -->\n            <!-- Top Left: Introduction Text Block -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-7 bg-surface p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-center gs-reveal h-full\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-6 font-medium text-ink/70\">Prologue</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm leading-loose mb-10 font-sans text-ink/80 max-w-sm font-light\">\n                    Elevating modern aesthetics through intentional design. A curated approach to visual storytelling that transcends traditional boundaries, focusing on structural purity.\n                </p>\n                <span class=\"text-xs italic font-serif text-ink/60\">(Series 01)</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Right: Small Graphic Grid (2x2) -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-[1px] md:gap-[2px]\">\n                <div class=\"bg-panel flex items-center justify-center p-6 gs-reveal aspect-square\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-ink/40\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-panel flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 gs-reveal text-xs tracking-widest leading-loose text-ink/50 font-light aspect-square\">\n                    <span>A</span><span>I</span><span>B</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-panel flex items-center justify-center p-6 gs-reveal aspect-square\">\n                     <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-ink/50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M3 12h18M12 3v18\"></path></svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-panel gs-reveal aspect-square\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Middle Row: 3 Images spanning full width -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 grid grid-cols-3 gap-[1px] md:gap-[2px] h-40 md:h-56\">\n                <div class=\"bg-surface overflow-hidden gs-reveal relative\">\n                     <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780478964246-355bb3d0-7a25-4461-85b0-20a82ef03fb3.png\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover img-scale\" alt=\"Detail 1\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780478964246-355bb3d0-7a25-4461-85b0-20a82ef03fb3.png\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-surface overflow-hidden gs-reveal relative\">\n                     <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780478988950-b6a53cee-a6ef-43c4-a55c-6d02c4967b9d.png\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover img-scale object-bottom\" alt=\"Detail 2\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780478988950-b6a53cee-a6ef-43c4-a55c-6d02c4967b9d.png\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-surface overflow-hidden gs-reveal relative\">\n                    <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780479013895-5f9b2575-0676-4de0-b1f3-fee0ef340135.png\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover img-scale object-top\" alt=\"Detail 3\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780479013895-5f9b2575-0676-4de0-b1f3-fee0ef340135.png\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Spacer acting as a prominent horizontal line between blocks if gap isn't enough, but gap handles it -->\n\n            <!-- --- BOTTOM BLOCK --- -->\n            <!-- Bottom Left: Small Grid + Image -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-[1px] md:gap-[2px]\">\n                 <div class=\"bg-panel gs-reveal aspect-square\"></div>\n                 <div class=\"bg-panel gs-reveal aspect-square\"></div>\n                 <div class=\"bg-surface overflow-hidden gs-reveal aspect-square relative col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2 md:h-full\">\n                      <!-- Using an abstract image here to fit the small square/rectangle slot -->\n                      <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780479048699-f831802b-c0c9-4655-ac0d-51823ed69e32.png\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover img-scale\" alt=\"Abstract Context\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/6b63bdd8-c365-4ccf-9537-fafc57329c8c/2026-06-03/1780479048699-f831802b-c0c9-4655-ac0d-51823ed69e32.png\">\n                 </div>\n                 <div class=\"bg-panel gs-reveal aspect-square hidden md:block\"></div>\n                 <div class=\"bg-panel gs-reveal aspect-square hidden md:block\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right: Main Title Block -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-8 bg-surface p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-center relative gs-reveal overflow-hidden\">\n                 <h1 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-8 uppercase text-ink title-anim w-full\">\n                     Sartorial<br>Synthesis\n                 </h1>\n                 <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm leading-loose mb-12 font-sans text-ink/80 max-w-sm font-light\">\n                     Discovering harmony in asymmetrical structures. Our latest collection emphasizes fluidity, tactile texture, and the interplay of ambient light and profound shadow.\n                 </p>\n\n                 <!-- Logo / Brand element at bottom -->\n                 <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-ink/10 brand-anim\">\n                     <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:triangle-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                     <span>Vertex</span>\n                 </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Script: WebGL & GSAP Animation Sequence -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            \n            // --- 1. KINETIC TYPOGRAPHY SETUP ---\n            const titleEl = document.querySelector('.title-anim');\n            // Simple split text for animation without external plugins\n            const words = titleEl.innerHTML.split('<br>');\n            titleEl.innerHTML = '';\n            \n            words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                const lineDiv = document.createElement('div');\n                lineDiv.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                lineDiv.style.display = 'block';\n                \n                const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                innerSpan.style.display = 'block';\n                innerSpan.className = 'title-line-inner';\n                innerSpan.innerHTML = word + (index < words.length - 1 ? '<br>' : '');\n                \n                lineDiv.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                titleEl.appendChild(lineDiv);\n            });\n\n            // --- 2. GSAP TIMELINE (Deterministic 5-10s arc) ---\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ \n                defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" },\n                delay: 0.2 // Slight delay to ensure render\n            });\n\n            // Set initial states to avoid FOUC\n            gsap.set('.right-pane', { xPercent: 100 });\n            gsap.set('.gs-reveal', { opacity: 0, y: 30 });\n            gsap.set('.img-scale', { scale: 1.2 });\n            gsap.set('.title-line-inner', { yPercent: 100 });\n            gsap.set('.brand-anim', { opacity: 0, x: -20 });\n\n            // Beat 1: Left image settles in (0s -> 2s)\n            tl.to('.hero-img', {\n                scale: 1,\n                duration: 2.5,\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            }, 0);\n\n            // Beat 2: Right panel slides in covering half (0.5s -> 1.5s)\n            tl.to('.right-pane', {\n                xPercent: 0,\n                duration: 1.4,\n                ease: \"expo.inOut\"\n            }, 0.3);\n\n            // Beat 3: Grid items stagger reveal (1.2s -> 3s)\n            tl.to('.gs-reveal', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: {\n                    amount: 0.6,\n                    grid: \"auto\",\n                    from: \"start\"\n                }\n            }, 1.2);\n\n            // Beat 4: Images inside grid scale down smoothly (1.4s -> 3.4s)\n            tl.to('.img-scale', {\n                scale: 1,\n                duration: 2,\n                stagger: { amount: 0.4 },\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            }, 1.4);\n\n            // Beat 5: Kinetic Typography Main Title pushes up (2s -> 3s)\n            tl.to('.title-line-inner', {\n                yPercent: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\"\n            }, 1.8);\n\n            // Beat 6: Final brand details fade in (2.5s -> 3.5s)\n            tl.to('.brand-anim', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                x: 0,\n                duration: 1\n            }, 2.2);\n\n\n            // --- 3. WEBGL BACKGROUND LAYER (Graceful fallback handled by low opacity & mix-blend) ---\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            if (container && window.THREE) {\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false });\n                \n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)); // Perf optimization\n                container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n                // Simple fluid noise shader\n                const vertexShader = `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main() {\n                        vUv = uv;\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const fragmentShader = `\n                    uniform float uTime;\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                    // Pseudo-random noise\n                    vec3 mod289(vec3 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n                    vec2 mod289(vec2 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n                    vec3 permute(vec3 x) { return mod289(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x); }\n\n                    float snoise(vec2 v) {\n                        const vec4 C = vec4(0.211324865405187, 0.366025403784439, -0.577350269189626, 0.024390243902439);\n                        vec2 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yy) );\n                        vec2 x0 = v -   i + dot(i, C.xx);\n                        vec2 i1;\n                        i1 = (x0.x > x0.y) ? vec2(1.0, 0.0) : vec2(0.0, 1.0);\n                        vec4 x12 = x0.xyxy + C.xxzz;\n                        x12.xy -= i1;\n                        i = mod289(i);\n                        vec3 p = permute( permute( i.y + vec3(0.0, i1.y, 1.0 )) + i.x + vec3(0.0, i1.x, 1.0 ));\n                        vec3 m = max(0.5 - vec3(dot(x0,x0), dot(x12.xy,x12.xy), dot(x12.zw,x12.zw)), 0.0);\n                        m = m*m;\n                        m = m*m;\n                        vec3 x = 2.0 * fract(p * C.www) - 1.0;\n                        vec3 h = abs(x) - 0.5;\n                        vec3 ox = floor(x + 0.5);\n                        vec3 a0 = x - ox;\n                        m *= 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * ( a0*a0 + h*h );\n                        vec3 g;\n                        g.x  = a0.x  * x0.x  + h.x  * x0.y;\n                        g.yz = a0.yz * x12.xz + h.yz * x12.yw;\n                        return 130.0 * dot(m, g);\n                    }\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 uv = vUv;\n                        \n                        // Slow movement\n                        float t = uTime * 0.15;\n                        \n                        // Distort UVs\n                        vec2 noiseUv = uv * 2.0;\n                        float n1 = snoise(noiseUv + vec2(t, t));\n                        float n2 = snoise(noiseUv + vec2(-t, t * 0.5));\n                        \n                        // Mix colors based on noise (matching Tailwind theme roughly)\n                        // Colors: #dcdcc6 (Panel), #f5f5f0 (Surface), #1c2016 (Ink)\n                        vec3 col1 = vec3(0.86, 0.86, 0.78); // panel approx\n                        vec3 col2 = vec3(0.96, 0.96, 0.94); // surface approx\n                        vec3 col3 = vec3(0.11, 0.13, 0.09); // ink approx\n\n                        float mixVal = smoothstep(-1.0, 1.0, n1 + n2 * 0.5);\n                        vec3 finalColor = mix(col1, col3, mixVal);\n                        \n                        // Add some subtle surface color\n                        finalColor = mix(finalColor, col2, smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, snoise(uv * 3.0 - t)));\n\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                    vertexShader,\n                    fragmentShader,\n                    uniforms: {\n                        uTime: { value: 0 }\n                    }\n                });\n\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                scene.add(mesh);\n\n                let time = 0;\n                function animate() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    time += 0.01;\n                    material.uniforms.uTime.value = time;\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                }\n\n                // Fade in WebGL slightly after load\n                gsap.fromTo(renderer.domElement, { opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1, duration: 3, delay: 1 });\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if (container && renderer) {\n                        renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "aesthetic-synthesis.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aesthetic-synthesis.jpg", "source_name": "aesthetic-synthesis-DESIGN.md", "views": 117, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T03:56:10.257148+00:00"}